    "testimonials_w8RPiC": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_ULLBbK": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Paid for itself after the first use. If you have one or more dogs you take to the groomer stop doing that and buy this. It was SUPER easy to use and it did not freak out my dogs. Best thing since sliced bread.</p>",
            "author": "Michele Praytor",
            "author_info": "May 15, 2025"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_xJtPeN": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>This vacuum is without a doubt the best purchase I have ever made.  I have a Border Collie and Belgian Malinois and they shed like crazy.  This little vacuum has made my life so much easier!  I have never written a review before but just needed to let you know how great your product is.  </p>",
            "author": "Suzanne Templet",
            "author_info": "Jul 12, 2025"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_hUNMEg": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I got my one is all 7 in 1 . My cocker spaniel is usually very anxious with any equipment and noises. He is not bothered by this equipment and it has great suctioning, I have trimmed his hair on the feet, face, and head and it worked perfectly and no mess due to the vacuum. </p>",
            "author": "Cindy",
            "author_info": "Dec 14, 2024"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_tnetaB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I used this on my Shih Tzu  abd I'm soooo pleased with the job it did. I was done in no time and my dog(Max) was relaxed the entire time. Best if all, clean up was practically nil. My husband and I are very happy. What a great investment.</p>",
            "author": "Eva M Sanchez",
            "author_info": "Sep 08, 2024"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_QLHn9x": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>This is Awesome!! I have 3 Shihtzus that I have been home grooming and the hair gets everywhere, this clipper vacuum works just like it’s advertised I trimmed 2 out of the 3 yesterday and it captured the hair just as advertised. The clipper attachments are great aswell. The noise level is low as well it didn’t scare my babies</p>",
            "author": "CG",
            "author_info": "Dec 13, 2023"
          }
        }
      },
